From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:42:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: support configurable simultaneous videos per
 source
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Separate source slots from video slots with a general 1–3 per-source setting (default 2). Reconcile stable episode jobs after cancellation finishes and serialize conflicting output filenames. Retain the MissAV-only HLS segment engine scope.

Eight focused regressions include actual two-video loopback HTTP segment transfer, source/video limit independence, failure replacement, repeated updates, safe shrink/restart and conflicting file names. This is an Anikku queue capability; Mihon image downloads and Animeko independent KMP engines are outside this requested feature.
